{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/caaf151ebb4c6e76a8db25fe8dcb45b7.avif?t=1758134168\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a thrilling turn-based strategy pirate game</strong> that masterfully blends roguelike elements with intense arena <strong>naval combat.</strong> Make critical decisions, adapt to ever-changing situations, and outsmart your enemies at every turn. Command your ship through fierce battles and rise as the ultimate pirate champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/c6ba4f615d52ffda86f26f7bf13f4741.webp?t=1758134168\" width=600 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/eb7e4f9746bca50eb9d01f19a4665d62.poster.avif?t=1758134168\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/eb7e4f9746bca50eb9d01f19a4665d62.webm?t=1758134168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/eb7e4f9746bca50eb9d01f19a4665d62.mp4?t=1758134168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Execute moves simultaneously</strong> for strategic prediction and positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Navigate obstacles</strong> and leverage the environment to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Utilize the wind</strong> to reduce movement costs when sailing with it, avoid the storm or use it to escape chasing players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fear the ever-growing <strong>curse of the sea.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/6e271bd38df06e7289a521a734512ef4.webp?t=1758134168\" width=600 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/0fbcb34dd737527d6b69fb18b7c2d362.poster.avif?t=1758134168\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/0fbcb34dd737527d6b69fb18b7c2d362.webm?t=1758134168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/0fbcb34dd737527d6b69fb18b7c2d362.mp4?t=1758134168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pick between <strong>various upgrades</strong> to increase your power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Unleash environmental chaos</strong> causing misfortune throughout the seven seas, giving you both advantages and disadvantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steer the course of battle by picking between <strong>special mythic perks</strong> with even greater powers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/2f320a51f8b666169365b51387a4ad28.webp?t=1758134168\" width=600 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/405353f2d53ca9a32894a87b9d210b88.poster.avif?t=1758134168\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014870/extras/405353f2d53ca9a32894a87b9d210b88.webm?t=1758134168\" ty